# Proxy /api/* to the FastAPI backend so the browser sees same-origin
# and no CORS handshake is required. This is a hard fix for
# environments (ISP proxies, corporate networks, buggy extensions) that
# strip CORS headers between the API and the browser.
/api/*  https://am-replenishment.onrender.com/api/:splat  200

# SPA fallback for client-side routing (leave as-is)
/*  /index.html  200
